# Docs & extra markdown: not committed. Keep one root README.md in the repo.
# (Optional: keep a local `docs/` folder or host notes in a wiki.)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
docs/
REALTIME_UPDATES_SUMMARY.md
WEBSOCKET_SETUP.md

# Local markdown sidecars / backups
**/*.md.local
**/*.md.bak
**/*~.md
